kattri (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Parental controls fail closed for unrated media and cover every media list.
  * Expired sessions, paging, card-menu toggles, artwork, episode stills and
    neighbours recover correctly after transient failures.
  * Downloads resume from a per-job durable snapshot after a crash; legal short
    range responses no longer fail the transfer.
  * Relay rewrites playlists classified by URL or content type and bounds
    manifest lines; provider thumbnails require public HTTPS.
  * Window host exits non-zero when GL startup fails, reuses the video texture
    on resize, and reports screenshot results from libmpv.
  * Release packages carry the project license and libmpv notice; release
    binaries no longer embed debug info.

 -- Jellyfin Kattri <krishiattriwork@gmail.com>  Wed, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

kattri (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ambient movie and show artwork on Home and library pages, with an optional
    local custom backdrop.
  * Library views, subtitle search and seek previews.
  * Item menu metadata editing, identify and image management for administrators.

